WEBVTT

01:28.440 --> 01:35.270
Our Secret
EP17

01:45.770 --> 01:46.920
It's our Comics Club.

01:47.730 --> 01:48.970
This is the club's pictorial.

01:49.690 --> 01:51.410
Anyway, the task to select candidates

01:51.410 --> 01:52.560
will be handed to you.

01:53.480 --> 01:55.130
I truly trust your vision.

01:58.240 --> 01:58.920
President

01:59.480 --> 02:01.650
This is the pictorial you asked me to draw last week.

02:02.240 --> 02:03.090
Right, Ding Xian.

02:03.370 --> 02:04.480
Let me introduce her to you.

02:05.130 --> 02:07.330
This is the chief editor of Dream Journey Press.

02:07.560 --> 02:09.160
She's also the organizer of this competition.

02:09.850 --> 02:10.770
This is Ding Xian.

02:13.600 --> 02:14.520
Pretty good!

02:15.490 --> 02:16.210
A freshman?

02:18.640 --> 02:20.080
Have you ever taken part in

02:20.210 --> 02:21.410
other competitions organized by other presses?

02:22.880 --> 02:23.570
No.

02:24.240 --> 02:25.969
Drawing is just my hobby before.

02:27.880 --> 02:30.210
Well, your president is right.

02:30.410 --> 02:31.410
The girl

02:32.000 --> 02:33.240
is truly talented.

02:34.520 --> 02:36.290
I feel so relieved that you have such a great drawer.

02:36.520 --> 02:38.520
I'll leave to you the rest of the issues of the competition.

02:39.570 --> 02:40.360
I should go now.

02:40.850 --> 02:41.850
Okay. Take care.

02:43.880 --> 02:46.210
How's that? Are you interested in the competition?

02:46.850 --> 02:48.050
President, I have something to do.

02:48.520 --> 02:49.440
I'll go now.

03:23.330 --> 03:25.440
How do you know I like this?

03:25.690 --> 03:26.640
It's a gift from the store.

03:28.080 --> 03:29.240
Don't be like before,

03:29.969 --> 03:31.930
sleepless after drinking coffee.

03:38.490 --> 03:39.850
You've been doing the paper for two days,

03:39.850 --> 03:40.770
and you haven't finished yet?

03:41.520 --> 03:42.930
Stop doing it if you can't.

03:44.520 --> 03:46.770
Didn't you forbid me to join in the scientific research group?

03:47.440 --> 03:49.080
It's none of your business.

03:50.290 --> 03:51.800
The store's closing. Go back earlier.

04:20.849 --> 04:21.919
Let me walk you back.

04:41.170 --> 04:42.799
Didn't you say you wouldn't go back to the campus?

04:45.130 --> 04:46.920
I will go to the laboratory tomorrow morning.

04:47.520 --> 04:48.640
To save the time.

05:25.080 --> 05:26.520
What are you smirking about?

05:27.360 --> 05:28.200
Nothing.

06:23.610 --> 06:24.360
Wait!

06:27.970 --> 06:28.920
Who is it?

06:29.410 --> 06:31.800
Is it our Zhou Siyue, Boss Zhou?

06:32.690 --> 06:34.320
Why do you come back to the dormitory?

06:37.970 --> 06:40.480
I should guarantee that stalker

06:40.480 --> 06:41.920
doesn't reappear.

06:42.640 --> 06:43.450
Stalker?

06:48.799 --> 06:50.290
Just tell me

06:50.290 --> 06:52.290
you sent Ding Xian to her dormitory!

06:54.890 --> 06:55.610
Did you?

06:56.010 --> 06:56.799
Did you?

06:57.290 --> 06:58.040
Did you?

06:58.200 --> 06:58.920
Did you?

06:59.240 --> 07:01.010
Tell me! We're brothers!

07:05.920 --> 07:06.890
Morning.

07:07.850 --> 07:08.920
Morning, bro.

07:09.200 --> 07:11.240
You look so different after sleeping in the dormitory!

07:24.130 --> 07:25.010
Have a look.

07:26.290 --> 07:30.240
Circuits and Electronics: Data Integration of Analog and Digital Electronics.

07:30.410 --> 07:31.970
Haven't we learned it as freshmen? Why did you do with it?

07:32.730 --> 07:33.760
To have a review.

07:38.640 --> 07:39.690
What a complete one!

07:42.920 --> 07:43.970
If any student

07:44.010 --> 07:46.200
who wants to join in our group this year finds this,

07:46.799 --> 07:48.010
he or she will be so happy!

07:50.200 --> 07:52.410
Are you going to bribe a girl with this?

07:52.920 --> 07:54.730
You can tell me, and I'll lend it to you.

07:54.920 --> 07:55.920
No.

07:56.520 --> 07:58.520
If I do what you said, I'll make it by myself.

07:59.240 --> 08:00.170
-Give it back.  -Wait.

08:00.200 --> 08:01.450
You…you've already made it.

08:01.690 --> 08:03.290
Lend it to me. Do me a favor.

08:04.890 --> 08:05.920
What can I get from it?

08:07.290 --> 08:08.170
You see,

08:09.850 --> 08:11.450
if I succeed,

08:11.850 --> 08:15.200
I'll serve you in any way you like.

08:15.610 --> 08:17.290
Let me tell you, I know a girl.

08:17.800 --> 08:19.010
She lives in the same dormitory as Ding Xian.

08:19.320 --> 08:21.320
So beautiful!

08:24.850 --> 08:26.520
Okay. I'll lend it to you.

08:27.200 --> 08:28.800
If you succeed, treat me a meal.

08:28.970 --> 08:30.080
Of course!

08:31.040 --> 08:31.970
I'm leaving.

08:32.610 --> 08:33.520
Didn't you just come for a while?

08:34.410 --> 08:36.080
To get more sleep.

08:37.049 --> 08:37.970
Bye-bye.

08:39.319 --> 08:40.410
Don't worry, Jiayu.

08:40.559 --> 08:42.049
The material can really help you a lot.

08:42.760 --> 08:43.679
Thanks, Yuan.

08:45.610 --> 08:46.760
We can be WeChat friends.

08:46.930 --> 08:48.640
If you have any question, just ask me directly.

08:48.970 --> 08:50.490
See? Yuan Fang

08:51.200 --> 08:53.120
is really blunt at reading other people's mind!

08:53.730 --> 08:55.440
Ban Jiayu has no reactions at all.

08:55.970 --> 08:58.200
Obviously, she has no interest in him.

08:58.760 --> 09:00.490
Why does he still help her?

09:06.610 --> 09:07.440
What's this?

09:07.810 --> 09:09.640
A test material given by Yuan Fang.

09:10.320 --> 09:11.850
Well, I don't understand

09:12.370 --> 09:14.170
why you want to join in the scientific research group.

09:14.760 --> 09:16.560
Tiring and hard to pass the test.

09:16.810 --> 09:18.410
See? Here comes the instruction.

09:21.290 --> 09:22.080
Let me see.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.320
Ding Xian

09:27.730 --> 09:29.200
What about copying one for you?

09:29.370 --> 09:31.290
Great! I really need it.

09:40.170 --> 09:41.760
Before answering any question,

09:42.170 --> 09:42.880
be careful of

09:42.970 --> 09:44.440
the information given by the question.

09:45.080 --> 09:45.970
This question.

09:47.610 --> 09:48.850
Prove…

09:50.410 --> 09:51.760
I bet you didn't read it carefully.

09:52.170 --> 09:53.970
You even didn't notice the wrong word.

09:55.810 --> 09:57.370
Who'd like to

09:57.440 --> 09:59.200
find wrong words on the paper?

09:59.930 --> 10:00.850
I do.

10:12.290 --> 10:13.120
Hello.

10:13.290 --> 10:13.970
Hello.

10:14.120 --> 10:15.000
I want to ask you something.

10:15.200 --> 10:17.370
How to order food on my phone?

10:17.410 --> 10:18.930
Could you please teach me?

10:19.880 --> 10:22.000
According to your demands,

10:22.200 --> 10:23.290
click the goods on your phone,

10:23.490 --> 10:24.560
and pay the bill directly.

10:24.760 --> 10:27.730
Then you can take your food by the counter with the number you get.

10:29.050 --> 10:31.810
But there's no introduction of the food in this page.

10:32.440 --> 10:33.760
Could you please give me some recommendations?

10:33.970 --> 10:35.320
What's your specialties?

10:37.170 --> 10:39.050
You can order according to

10:39.050 --> 10:40.120
the menu.

10:42.930 --> 10:44.610
Can I add you as a WeChat friend?

10:45.680 --> 10:47.440
I'll often drop by the store!

10:48.320 --> 10:49.760
This is the QR code of the store.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.490
If you need to order a seat,

10:51.680 --> 10:53.290
you can scan the QR code directly.

10:54.200 --> 10:55.120
I'm sorry.

10:58.810 --> 10:59.610
Go!

10:59.640 --> 11:00.730
What? Hurry up!

11:24.290 --> 11:25.520
Aren't you busy?

11:26.610 --> 11:28.000
I should eat anyhow.

11:34.050 --> 11:35.410
Isn't the test coming?

11:35.640 --> 11:36.850
Why do you have time to be here?

11:38.610 --> 11:39.410
Don't worry.

11:39.810 --> 11:42.050
I accidentally got a good treasure.

11:42.250 --> 11:43.200
I'm sure I'll pass the test.

11:46.050 --> 11:47.730
The scientific research group of Professor Ye

11:48.250 --> 11:49.440
is not that easy to get in.

11:52.560 --> 11:54.440
I also felt I had no hope.

11:54.970 --> 11:57.440
But after reading through the material just now,

11:57.680 --> 11:59.320
I find it much easier to understand.

11:59.560 --> 12:01.930
I suddenly understand so many knowledge nodes in it.

12:02.610 --> 12:03.440
See?

12:04.170 --> 12:05.880
There're a table of content and conclusions,

12:06.080 --> 12:07.320
and examples of wrong answers.

12:07.520 --> 12:08.640
So thoughtful!

12:10.320 --> 12:11.320
Seriously,

12:12.080 --> 12:13.520
the strange habit to pick up wrong words

12:13.730 --> 12:15.730
is really like yours!

12:23.000 --> 12:23.880
Are you kidding me?

12:29.490 --> 12:32.760
Did I really have an illusion?

12:43.640 --> 12:45.410
Don't think too much.

12:48.000 --> 12:48.760
Ding Xian

12:49.810 --> 12:50.880
If now I still

12:51.520 --> 12:52.810
want to persuade you not to do it,

12:53.320 --> 12:54.520
am I too late?

12:55.440 --> 12:56.520
It's good you're clear about it.

13:00.000 --> 13:01.320
Then wish you good luck.

13:02.170 --> 13:03.490
Thanks.

13:08.080 --> 13:10.560
Why don't you give me a meal? I also want to eat.

13:12.640 --> 13:14.000
I'm a guest today!

13:16.730 --> 13:18.410
I also want to eat!

13:46.080 --> 13:46.930
Let me tell you.

13:47.170 --> 13:48.640
I've inquired about it yesterday.

13:48.880 --> 13:49.730
The list is shown up today.

13:50.410 --> 13:51.320
Ban Jiayu

13:51.930 --> 13:53.050
You must be in it!

13:55.080 --> 13:56.050
I dare not see it.

13:56.250 --> 13:57.000
Let me help you to look at it.

13:57.410 --> 13:58.170
Help me to look at it.

13:58.200 --> 13:58.730
Okay.

14:04.930 --> 14:06.170
No, there's not.

14:07.520 --> 14:08.880
Don't look for my name if I'm not there.

14:09.760 --> 14:11.120
Aren't you worried?

14:11.320 --> 14:12.440
I didn't have any hope at the beginning.

14:12.610 --> 14:13.850
I can change another field.

14:15.290 --> 14:17.970
Well, it's just a choice.

14:18.290 --> 14:19.200
Ding Xian

14:20.250 --> 14:21.320
You got in!

14:21.680 --> 14:22.610
See? She got in!

14:22.730 --> 14:23.440
Look!

14:27.080 --> 14:28.680
I've told you that you would be chosen.

14:29.680 --> 14:32.170
I got in! I got in!

14:41.880 --> 14:44.880
Siyue, the girl called Ding Xian we met last time

14:46.050 --> 14:47.120
really got in our group.

14:47.970 --> 14:49.120
Is she junior to you?

14:50.760 --> 14:51.610
No.

14:52.170 --> 14:53.880
We were classmates in senior high school.

14:54.320 --> 14:55.610
She studied in the high school for another year.

14:56.810 --> 14:58.760
I didn't expect that she could get such a high grade!

14:59.080 --> 15:00.120
She makes me a little bit astonished.

15:01.370 --> 15:03.880
Her solutions to questions are just like yours.

15:06.370 --> 15:08.200
It's not strange that she got in.

15:08.410 --> 15:09.810
She is always a clever student.

15:10.850 --> 15:12.050
Zhou Siyue! Zhou Siyue!

15:12.080 --> 15:13.410
I passed…

15:16.520 --> 15:18.200
Here she comes.

15:25.170 --> 15:26.290
Sorry, Professor Ye.

15:26.290 --> 15:27.760
I didn't see you just now.

15:28.050 --> 15:29.440
I've seen your paper.

15:29.730 --> 15:30.730
Pretty good.

15:31.250 --> 15:32.850
But after getting into the scientific research group,

15:33.320 --> 15:34.640
there will be an assessment period.

15:35.120 --> 15:36.320
You should be prepared.

15:37.200 --> 15:39.250
I will. Thank you, Professor Ye.

15:42.930 --> 15:43.930
Continue your chat.

15:59.120 --> 16:00.000
Great!

16:00.440 --> 16:02.290
I approached closer to studying abroad with you!

16:02.610 --> 16:04.490
It will be more difficult in the assessment period.

16:05.410 --> 16:06.970
If your task is not passed,

16:07.370 --> 16:09.370
you have no way to get into the core experiment group.

16:09.970 --> 16:11.490
Don't always discourage me.

16:15.850 --> 16:16.850
Ding Xian

16:20.640 --> 16:22.320
Are you sure you will like to do all of these?

16:23.050 --> 16:24.120
Doing experiments,

16:24.410 --> 16:25.370
writing programs,

16:25.760 --> 16:27.880
and collecting data every day.

16:28.680 --> 16:30.320
You won't be interested in all of these.

16:31.320 --> 16:32.370
If you like these,

16:32.810 --> 16:34.370
why won't I?

16:36.880 --> 16:38.520
Alright. I won't bother you.

16:38.680 --> 16:39.810
I'm leaving now.

16:59.370 --> 17:01.170
The fried chicken is ordered by me!

17:01.610 --> 17:02.680
I fetched it!

17:03.170 --> 17:04.170
You want to eat?

17:04.850 --> 17:06.560
Then apologize to me.

17:07.040 --> 17:08.560
Call me daddy if you want to eat.

17:13.610 --> 17:15.130
-Daddy.  -Sorry.

17:17.800 --> 17:18.890
Okay. Okay.

17:21.729 --> 17:22.770
Here you are.

17:25.080 --> 17:26.200
Disgusting!

17:32.920 --> 17:33.970
Tell you something.

17:37.160 --> 17:38.680
Ding Xian has got in our scientific research group.

17:40.610 --> 17:41.890
Good. She's close to you.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.440
Good?

17:46.800 --> 17:47.650
Think about it.

17:48.130 --> 17:49.650
Ding Xian reviewed for another year.

17:49.970 --> 17:51.370
She was so arduous for me.

17:52.080 --> 17:54.040
She got into Hua Qing University for me.

17:54.650 --> 17:56.650
And she got in the scientific research group for me!

17:56.800 --> 17:58.400
She doesn't like these at all!

18:00.530 --> 18:01.770
Just like Kong Shadi.

18:02.490 --> 18:03.610
If Kong Shadi

18:04.560 --> 18:05.650
gives up what she likes

18:05.650 --> 18:06.560
because of you,

18:06.610 --> 18:07.490
do you like it?

18:07.920 --> 18:09.010
So I ran away from her.

18:13.160 --> 18:14.650
In my opinion, even so,

18:15.250 --> 18:16.370
you must

18:16.770 --> 18:18.280
have no way to resist from showing her your love.

18:20.920 --> 18:21.890
No way.

18:22.610 --> 18:23.440
I don't believe you.

18:28.130 --> 18:29.440
In the next three months,

18:29.730 --> 18:32.200
we'll do a task assessment every month.

18:32.560 --> 18:33.850
The student who passes all assessments

18:34.200 --> 18:35.800
is able to stay eventually.

18:36.440 --> 18:38.920
For the first week, Dong Zhengfei will

18:39.280 --> 18:40.890
lead you to get familiar with the environment.

18:41.400 --> 18:42.440
From the next week,

18:42.650 --> 18:45.280
every student should hand in your new task.

18:51.440 --> 18:52.680
I won't say any other words.

18:52.970 --> 18:54.160
Dong Zhengfei, make an arrangement.

18:54.650 --> 18:55.200
Okay.

18:55.920 --> 18:56.560
Follow me.

18:58.280 --> 18:59.280
The laboratory

18:59.890 --> 19:01.440
is open for 24 hours every day.

19:02.160 --> 19:03.490
Professor Ye gives classes

19:03.560 --> 19:05.800
from 6:30 pm to 10:30 pm.

19:06.080 --> 19:08.250
As for other time, you can arrange by yourself.

19:09.560 --> 19:11.160
However, if you really intend to

19:11.160 --> 19:12.680
join in our scientific research group,

19:12.770 --> 19:13.530
you should sacrifice

19:13.560 --> 19:15.160
all the time for entertainment

19:15.490 --> 19:17.280
and stay in the laboratory from day till night.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.010
Be prepared at any time.

19:19.970 --> 19:20.730
Have a seat.

19:24.130 --> 19:25.130
The scientific research

19:25.250 --> 19:27.680
is truly a boring thing to do.

19:28.280 --> 19:29.320
And because of it,

19:29.560 --> 19:31.400
everyone should be fully concentrated.

19:31.800 --> 19:33.440
If you don't have enough passion,

19:33.850 --> 19:35.040
you'd better give up as early as possible.

19:36.490 --> 19:37.200
Come on!

19:37.680 --> 19:39.850
I'm sure I'll stay in the scientific research group!

19:49.890 --> 19:51.610
Why are you in such a hurry for a whole day?

19:53.440 --> 19:54.850
Lou Feng. Do you have anything to eat?

19:55.400 --> 19:56.080
Yes.

19:56.800 --> 19:57.400
Hurry up.

19:58.800 --> 19:59.530
Another one.

20:00.010 --> 20:01.200
No. I really have no time.

20:01.280 --> 20:01.800
I'll go now.

20:01.800 --> 20:02.530
Get another one!

20:02.770 --> 20:03.650
There's no time!

20:37.160 --> 20:38.490
I'm sorry. I'm late.

20:38.770 --> 20:40.770
Again? Go ahead.

20:43.130 --> 20:43.770
I'm sorry.

20:44.010 --> 20:46.610
The assignment is… Let me see…

20:48.970 --> 20:50.920
Love is always making people tired!

20:53.200 --> 20:54.320
Don't slack off!

21:02.890 --> 21:03.730
Professor

21:03.970 --> 21:05.040
Did you hand in your task?

21:05.770 --> 21:07.650
Almost done. Give me another five minutes.

21:07.890 --> 21:08.770
Why should I wait for you?

21:09.400 --> 21:10.440
Everyone's handed in theirs!

21:11.250 --> 21:12.730
Is that your attitude to do scientific research?

21:13.560 --> 21:14.890
Do you have sense of time?

21:15.850 --> 21:16.730
I'm sorry.

21:37.650 --> 21:38.610
Go back now.

21:42.370 --> 21:43.200
No.

21:44.200 --> 21:45.850
Bugs in the program

21:45.920 --> 21:47.400
haven't been found.

22:01.080 --> 22:02.920
You'll tire to death sooner or later.

22:14.160 --> 22:16.730
You do much more things than me,

22:19.010 --> 22:21.200
but why aren't you tired?

22:21.850 --> 22:23.200
You should ask yourself

22:24.010 --> 22:26.010
why you make yourself so tired.

22:37.970 --> 22:40.280
Run the following program…

22:40.530 --> 22:41.770
No way! Ding Xian!

22:42.730 --> 22:44.490
Are you living in the library?

22:45.280 --> 22:46.530
Professor Ye has told me.

22:48.010 --> 22:49.770
As long as I can answer this question,

22:50.040 --> 22:51.890
the assessments in the next three months will be exempted,

22:52.080 --> 22:53.920
and I'll be a true member of the group.

22:54.920 --> 22:57.610
What if…you cannot solve it?

22:58.890 --> 23:00.530
Pack up and go.

23:01.770 --> 23:02.730
Professor Ye

23:03.440 --> 23:05.250
You are deliberately making hard on her.

23:05.800 --> 23:08.280
She's making hard on herself.

23:09.280 --> 23:12.040
If the question is given to juniors or seniors,

23:12.040 --> 23:13.250
they may not solve it.

23:16.440 --> 23:17.320
What's going on?

23:20.010 --> 23:21.040
The code is wrong.

23:25.490 --> 23:26.370
Siyue

23:27.610 --> 23:28.440
Not only her.

23:28.850 --> 23:30.200
You also should figure out

23:30.440 --> 23:31.370
what on earth you are doing.

23:35.890 --> 23:36.920
I won't make mistakes again.

23:42.680 --> 23:43.560
What are you looking at?

23:47.160 --> 23:48.130
Give me an idea.

23:48.680 --> 23:49.850
In what way

23:49.970 --> 23:51.080
can I talk with him?

23:53.970 --> 23:56.370
Ask him how to solve the question.

23:56.920 --> 23:57.730
Good idea.

24:06.680 --> 24:07.800
Well, hello.

24:08.890 --> 24:11.160
I have a question. I don't know if you have any time.

24:11.490 --> 24:12.370
Could you please have a look at it?

24:12.370 --> 24:13.850
Okay. Let me see.

24:17.800 --> 24:19.080
You're only a freshman.

24:19.400 --> 24:21.200
Why does your professor give you such a hard question?

24:22.040 --> 24:24.400
It's a question given to Ding Xian by Professor Ye.

24:24.610 --> 24:25.850
Only when Ding Xian solved the question

24:26.010 --> 24:27.320
can she stay in the scientific research group.

24:28.130 --> 24:29.160
What a surprise!

24:29.400 --> 24:30.370
She's really hard-working!

24:30.650 --> 24:32.850
She does this for his high school classmate Zhou Siyue.

24:33.200 --> 24:34.800
The girl works late at night every day.

24:35.080 --> 24:36.160
She's tired as a dog!

24:36.370 --> 24:37.440
Just to get in the scientific research group,

24:37.560 --> 24:38.530
and to go abroad with him.

24:41.440 --> 24:42.200
Is she

24:43.160 --> 24:44.160
that confident?

24:45.040 --> 24:46.200
Let me tell you,

24:46.440 --> 24:47.200
in order to get in the scientific research group…

24:47.200 --> 24:49.280
I cannot solve the question right now.

24:49.770 --> 24:50.920
It's okay.

24:51.490 --> 24:52.370
Add you as a WeChat friend.

24:52.680 --> 24:54.490
If you solve the question, send the answer to me.

24:54.610 --> 24:55.250
Okay.

25:04.280 --> 25:06.730
There's only one quota for the overseas exchange every year.

25:06.970 --> 25:09.650
Does Professor Ye really appoint Zhou Siyue secretly?

25:11.080 --> 25:11.920
How's that?

25:12.560 --> 25:13.610
I've got his WeChat!

25:15.010 --> 25:16.400
I mean the question.

25:16.730 --> 25:18.040
The question? He doesn't know how to solve it.

25:18.490 --> 25:19.970
That hard?

25:21.440 --> 25:22.770
Does Professor Ye

25:23.370 --> 25:24.560
make it difficult for you deliberately?

25:31.320 --> 25:32.130
I'll go now.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.490
Bro, I'm also leaving now.

25:35.490 --> 25:36.530
Bye-bye.

25:37.080 --> 25:37.970
Bye-bye.

26:02.250 --> 26:03.040
Zhou Siyue

26:08.890 --> 26:10.680
The assignment given by Professor Ye

26:10.850 --> 26:11.890
is out of my capability.

26:12.040 --> 26:12.970
I won't help you.

26:17.850 --> 26:18.770
Please.

26:19.400 --> 26:20.370
No way.

26:24.970 --> 26:27.010
Help me!

26:27.730 --> 26:29.320
Only once!

26:29.770 --> 26:31.130
Don't act like that!

26:32.080 --> 26:34.250
Please! Only once!

26:44.080 --> 26:45.730
Have you done the experimental demonstration?

26:47.250 --> 26:48.320
Not yet.

26:50.610 --> 26:52.680
Then in accordance with your thoughts in your mind,

26:53.080 --> 26:54.650
write those codes down.

26:55.400 --> 26:57.010
No need to read books?

26:57.730 --> 26:59.920
It's of no use to read so many theories.

27:00.080 --> 27:01.080
If you don't practice,

27:01.080 --> 27:02.280
you cannot find the true question.

27:02.730 --> 27:03.490
Write them down first.

28:22.250 --> 28:24.320
What are you doing instead of solving the question?

28:32.920 --> 28:34.040
I cannot help doing it.

28:34.440 --> 28:35.370
Sorry.

28:41.040 --> 28:42.730
What do you think of my drawing?

28:48.680 --> 28:50.080
Better than solving the question.

28:50.680 --> 28:51.610
Really?

28:53.130 --> 28:55.490
I don't think it's as good as my drawings before.

28:55.920 --> 28:56.770
Before?

29:08.250 --> 29:09.400
What did you draw?

29:09.730 --> 29:10.650
It's a secret!

29:12.650 --> 29:13.970
As you wish.

29:18.680 --> 29:20.160
Didn't you say it was a secret?

29:21.680 --> 29:23.370
How could you tell me?

29:24.200 --> 29:26.010
Anyway, I like you, and I like to draw.

29:26.080 --> 29:28.250
They're not secrets anymore.

29:51.160 --> 29:52.040
Ding Xian

29:54.970 --> 29:56.370
Actually, I just hope

29:58.280 --> 29:59.080
you can choose

29:59.130 --> 30:00.890
what you really like to do.

30:09.680 --> 30:10.440
I will.

30:11.040 --> 30:12.370
So don't talk to me anymore.

30:12.730 --> 30:13.850
I should try to solve the question.

30:16.130 --> 30:17.320
Communication is forbidden.

30:40.920 --> 30:41.850
Mr. Zhou

30:43.370 --> 30:44.200
You've finished?

30:53.610 --> 30:54.680
Finished?

30:58.490 --> 30:59.250
Zero point.

31:01.200 --> 31:02.040
Why?

31:05.730 --> 31:07.280
What about the bugs of the information security?

31:08.130 --> 31:09.680
The information holes are so obvious.

31:09.770 --> 31:10.890
Didn't you notice them?

31:11.730 --> 31:13.160
If someone from the tech company

31:13.200 --> 31:14.280
gives you a task,

31:14.770 --> 31:16.130
you will be sued now.

31:19.200 --> 31:22.280
Didn't you tell me to write in this way?

31:22.530 --> 31:24.320
So we've found the problem.

31:26.200 --> 31:27.160
Redo it.

31:36.920 --> 31:37.770
Zhou Siyue

31:38.850 --> 31:39.680
I think now we're

31:39.850 --> 31:41.280
just like when we were in senior high school.

31:41.800 --> 31:43.890
When division of Arts and Sciences, you taught me mathematics.

31:44.130 --> 31:46.010
You are just... like before.

31:47.650 --> 31:48.730
How?

31:48.970 --> 31:50.250
You're mean like before.

31:57.490 --> 31:58.890
You're also the same.

31:59.560 --> 32:01.370
You still don't make any progress.

32:02.320 --> 32:04.650
According to your present professional level,

32:05.080 --> 32:06.730
you should consider changing your major.

32:07.370 --> 32:09.080
Don't be too harsh on me!

32:10.280 --> 32:11.650
I'm only a freshman.

32:14.200 --> 32:16.200
No one cares if you're a freshman or not.

32:16.650 --> 32:18.490
They only know that you're a student from Huaqing University.

32:19.560 --> 32:20.560
Besides,

32:22.080 --> 32:23.970
it's you who must get in the scientific research group.

32:38.490 --> 32:40.400
If you don't pass the assessment,

32:40.890 --> 32:41.920
it's pretty normal.

32:42.610 --> 32:44.040
Professor Ye is strict.

32:45.010 --> 32:46.040
Besides, I also think

32:47.610 --> 32:49.560
you don't need to get in the scientific research group.

32:49.920 --> 32:51.680
Zhou Siyue. You really look down upon me!

32:53.400 --> 32:56.160
Besides, I have you, such an expert!

32:56.920 --> 32:58.130
I'm sure I'll pass it.

33:09.200 --> 33:10.560
What do you mean?

33:10.890 --> 33:12.650
I ask you for a favor, and you act like this?

33:15.280 --> 33:16.250
Wait me for a while.

33:18.040 --> 33:20.400
The university holds a fraternity for the freshman.

33:20.610 --> 33:21.400
Are you going there with me?

33:21.400 --> 33:22.080
No.

33:23.850 --> 33:24.730
Zhou Siyue

33:24.730 --> 33:26.080
It's not good if you keep like this.

33:26.200 --> 33:27.200
Don't you have many

33:27.200 --> 33:28.080
entertainments before?

33:28.160 --> 33:29.890
Why do you stop chatting with others who are alive?

33:33.160 --> 33:35.920
Do what you should do in every period,

33:36.250 --> 33:37.610
so that you won't regret.

33:40.400 --> 33:41.320
Boring.

33:42.320 --> 33:43.280
Fine.

33:43.770 --> 33:46.490
I should learn from you. I won't go there, either.

33:46.770 --> 33:47.890
I'll go back to the laboratory.

33:48.610 --> 33:51.370
Do what you should do. No regret.

34:19.359 --> 34:20.290
Ding Xian

34:43.330 --> 34:44.089
Ding Xian

34:50.120 --> 34:50.879
Ding Xian

34:52.160 --> 34:52.920
Where are you?

35:08.010 --> 35:08.770
Ding Xian

35:39.400 --> 35:40.770
Are you okay?

36:00.090 --> 36:02.250
Why are you hiding here stealthily?

36:03.570 --> 36:05.330
Why are you so timid?

36:06.250 --> 36:07.570
Who is timid?

36:08.120 --> 36:09.440
Don't talk nonsense!

36:14.010 --> 36:16.290
Didn't you leave? Why do you come back?

36:18.530 --> 36:19.440
The power's off.

36:19.920 --> 36:21.570
What if the data are missing?

36:21.840 --> 36:23.250
Shouldn't I come back and check?

36:24.120 --> 36:24.810
I'll go.

36:29.530 --> 36:30.400
Didn't you say

36:30.730 --> 36:32.160
that you wouldn't help her

36:32.440 --> 36:33.290
after she got in the group?

36:33.490 --> 36:34.360
What were you doing?

36:35.880 --> 36:37.050
I didn't resist it.

36:38.160 --> 36:39.440
What did I say?

36:39.600 --> 36:40.400
You're so stubborn!

36:40.570 --> 36:41.530
Eat your food!

36:43.920 --> 36:45.290
Eat with me!

36:46.010 --> 36:47.010
No. I won't.

36:49.600 --> 36:50.920
If people are iron, food is steel.

36:51.120 --> 36:52.530
You'll be hungry if you miss one meal.

36:52.680 --> 36:54.250
You work and study every day,

36:54.440 --> 36:55.970
and often do experiments late at night.

36:56.250 --> 36:57.730
You should take care of your health.

36:57.970 --> 36:58.730
You know?

36:59.090 --> 37:01.250
How can you stay active if you don't eat?

37:01.570 --> 37:03.090
Why do you act like my mom?

37:04.160 --> 37:05.920
Come here. Good boy. Have a meal.

37:07.330 --> 37:08.400
Come on. Come on!

37:15.090 --> 37:16.120
The pork hock tastes good!

37:31.400 --> 37:33.120
Do you have any problem with your brain recently?

37:34.840 --> 37:35.920
What?

37:36.640 --> 37:37.530
Chopsticks.

37:38.440 --> 37:39.360
They're opposite down.

37:50.160 --> 37:51.160
Professor Ye

37:51.290 --> 37:52.360
Did I pass it?

37:54.160 --> 37:55.090
Pretty good.

37:56.250 --> 37:57.050
But there's another one

37:57.090 --> 37:58.530
who used the same solution as you did.

37:59.360 --> 38:00.770
You know who I'm talking about.

38:06.250 --> 38:07.200
Professor Ye

38:07.770 --> 38:10.050
It's true that I asked Zhou Siyue for help.

38:10.440 --> 38:11.640
But, I…

38:11.840 --> 38:13.330
You understand Zhou Siyue better than I do.

38:14.770 --> 38:16.440
He has a great passion on scientific research.

38:17.160 --> 38:18.490
And he can pass the passion

38:18.840 --> 38:19.920
to others.

38:20.680 --> 38:23.570
He's the one whom others want to chase after

38:24.570 --> 38:26.250
but cannot be caught up with forever.

38:27.490 --> 38:28.400
Ding Xian

38:28.880 --> 38:30.010
You're very clever.

38:31.570 --> 38:33.970
You should know what to do.

38:42.330 --> 38:44.010
Chocolate! Let me eat one.

38:44.770 --> 38:45.810
No way.

38:46.640 --> 38:48.120
It's a present for someone else.

38:48.440 --> 38:49.600
I'll buy it to you next time.

38:50.330 --> 38:51.440
A present?

38:53.600 --> 38:54.770
Is the robot

38:55.250 --> 38:56.840
drawn for Zhou Siyue?

38:58.200 --> 39:00.730
What's Zhou's feeling?

39:02.530 --> 39:03.730
What do you mean?

39:04.050 --> 39:05.880
You've been chasing him for such a long time.

39:06.330 --> 39:08.200
If you two

39:08.360 --> 39:10.490
are really good as what you said before,

39:11.050 --> 39:11.970
he should have

39:12.530 --> 39:14.490
expressed love to you now.

39:16.440 --> 39:19.050
I didn't ask him to be my boyfriend.

39:19.570 --> 39:21.330
Then what do you want from him?

39:23.920 --> 39:25.490
I didn't mean it.

39:26.200 --> 39:28.530
I just think you chased him so hard.

39:28.570 --> 39:29.840
I feel pretty bad!

39:30.770 --> 39:31.840
I think

39:32.250 --> 39:33.880
being happy is the most important thing.

39:33.970 --> 39:35.360
As long as you don't regret.

39:35.490 --> 39:37.490
Okay. I'll go wash now.

39:37.730 --> 39:38.680
Go to bed early.

39:39.490 --> 39:39.970
Good night.

39:40.050 --> 39:40.730
Good night.

39:47.010 --> 39:49.250
I don't care if you like Zhou Siyue or not.

39:49.880 --> 39:51.090
But, Ding Xian,

39:52.050 --> 39:54.200
I cannot feel your passion about the scientific research.

39:55.120 --> 39:56.400
I don't know how much

39:56.640 --> 39:58.530
you know about the prospect of the major.

39:59.680 --> 40:01.490
I also don't know how you plan for

40:02.010 --> 40:03.050
the future.

40:03.600 --> 40:04.730
I just hope

40:05.200 --> 40:07.810
before deciding to do scientific research,

40:08.360 --> 40:09.680
you can think about it clearly.

40:10.120 --> 40:12.330
You should be clear if Zhou Siyue is not here,

40:12.640 --> 40:15.360
what on earth your choice is.

40:34.290 --> 40:34.970
Ding Xian

40:36.600 --> 40:37.360
Dong

40:38.880 --> 40:40.680
Did you pass the exam set by Professor Ye?

40:41.600 --> 40:42.640
Kind of.

40:43.160 --> 40:44.770
Will you go abroad?

40:47.400 --> 40:48.640
I'm still trying.

40:50.330 --> 40:51.680
Actually, I always think

40:52.200 --> 40:53.730
you're such a smart girl.

40:54.330 --> 40:55.360
Why do you waste

40:55.880 --> 40:57.330
your time on such kind of things?

41:00.880 --> 41:02.160
What do you mean?

41:03.570 --> 41:05.290
You're just like a tail of Zhou Siyue.

41:06.050 --> 41:07.200
I really admire you.

41:08.330 --> 41:09.730
You're able to give up so many things

41:09.880 --> 41:10.600
for the person you like.

41:11.360 --> 41:12.530
But I don't think it worth

41:13.730 --> 41:14.530
doing it.

41:16.440 --> 41:17.360
Dong

41:18.680 --> 41:20.640
Whether it's worth or not isn't judged by

41:20.680 --> 41:21.640
how much you paid out.

41:23.330 --> 41:25.120
It's true that Zhou Siyue has marvelous

41:25.290 --> 41:26.050
professional competence.

41:26.640 --> 41:27.640
You are willing to

41:27.840 --> 41:29.290
do anything you don't like for him,

41:29.600 --> 41:31.120
but he will definitely not give up what he likes

41:31.360 --> 41:32.880
for anyone else.

41:34.840 --> 41:35.640
For example,

41:36.250 --> 41:37.570
giving up going abroad for you.

41:40.490 --> 41:41.400
It doesn't matter.

41:42.250 --> 41:43.730
I don't expect him to do anything for me.

41:45.120 --> 41:46.330
Then what if I tell you that

41:46.530 --> 41:48.640
it was him who told Professor Ye

41:49.530 --> 41:50.770
that you're not capable of doing scientific research?

41:54.250 --> 41:55.120
It's not important.

42:06.770 --> 42:07.490
Ding Xian

42:10.600 --> 42:11.330
Ding Xian

42:15.880 --> 42:16.570
I'm sorry, President.

42:16.570 --> 42:17.770
What did you just say?

42:18.120 --> 42:19.600
I said thanks for

42:19.680 --> 42:20.490
the task today.

42:21.640 --> 42:22.360
It's okay.

43:05.880 --> 43:06.730
Hello.

43:07.120 --> 43:08.160
Hello, Zhou Siyue.

43:08.440 --> 43:09.440
Where are you?

43:12.600 --> 43:13.840
Do you have anything to tell me?

43:14.920 --> 43:16.530
I knew you must be here!

43:17.200 --> 43:19.440
There's another problem in the program.

43:19.730 --> 43:21.360
Please help me check it.

43:21.810 --> 43:22.600
Thanks.

43:28.330 --> 43:29.730
What are you busy in doing?

43:29.880 --> 43:31.810
You didn't reply to me on WeChat every time.

43:32.840 --> 43:34.050
I was doing experiments.

43:35.330 --> 43:37.360
But you shouldn't always be in the laboratory.

43:37.440 --> 43:38.290
So boring!

43:38.570 --> 43:40.200
Why don't you join in our Comics Club?

43:40.290 --> 43:41.200
It's so fun!

43:43.290 --> 43:45.120
Right. We recently received an invitation

43:45.160 --> 43:46.680
of a drawing competition.

43:48.010 --> 43:48.840
Drawing competition?

43:49.200 --> 43:49.770
Right.

43:49.970 --> 43:51.250
The winner can sign with

43:51.290 --> 43:52.770
the Comics Press directly!

43:53.600 --> 43:54.600
Did Ding Xian take part in it?

43:55.090 --> 43:55.880
She?

43:56.360 --> 43:58.440
Actually, I thought she was really talented.

43:58.730 --> 43:59.810
If she took part in the competition,

43:59.880 --> 44:01.440
she might get a reward.

44:01.810 --> 44:02.680
But she refused.

44:02.920 --> 44:04.490
She said she was too busy to take part in it.

44:04.920 --> 44:06.880
I don't understand what a freshman like her

44:06.970 --> 44:08.160
is busy in doing.

44:26.330 --> 44:27.360
I've helped you revise it.

44:27.810 --> 44:28.770
No other problems.

44:30.330 --> 44:31.250
However,

44:31.530 --> 44:32.970
if you deliberately modify the program,

44:33.050 --> 44:34.330
I won't help you.

44:35.440 --> 44:36.920
You found it anyway.

44:38.570 --> 44:40.640
Okay. If you have nothing else to do, just leave.

44:40.770 --> 44:42.010
Okay. Let me treat you a meal.

44:47.840 --> 44:49.360
Why are you touching my thing?

44:50.120 --> 44:51.160
What?

44:51.570 --> 44:52.880
Isn't it just chocolate?

44:53.120 --> 44:54.680
Why did you say like that?

44:55.050 --> 44:56.570
The chocolate is given by someone else!

44:56.810 --> 44:58.010
Why are you so fierce to me?

44:58.050 --> 44:59.680
I didn't know it was given by someone else!

45:00.970 --> 45:01.570
I'll just buy you

45:01.600 --> 45:02.840
the same kind of chocolate!

45:03.330 --> 45:04.200
So mean!

45:04.730 --> 45:05.360
Thanks.

45:16.640 --> 45:17.770
Did you finish making tools?

45:20.160 --> 45:21.010
Almost done, President.

45:21.050 --> 45:22.250
Wait me for a while.

45:23.810 --> 45:25.360
Ding Xian, what's wrong with you today?

45:25.770 --> 45:27.400
Do you feel uncomfortable?

45:27.640 --> 45:29.050
Are you going to have a rest?

45:29.160 --> 45:30.010
I'm fine. I'm fine.

45:30.200 --> 45:31.290
It's almost finished.

45:31.330 --> 45:32.730
I won't retard the rehearsal tomorrow.

45:33.090 --> 45:33.570
Okay.

45:38.840 --> 45:40.730
President. Does Xing Lufei come here?

45:40.880 --> 45:42.090
They're asking for costumes again.

45:42.290 --> 45:42.970
Wait a minute.

45:44.120 --> 45:45.290
I'll call her.

45:45.440 --> 45:46.050
Okay.

45:46.880 --> 45:48.810
What's the hurry? Here I come.

45:49.400 --> 45:50.440
Great! Xing.

45:51.010 --> 45:52.330
How are the costumes prepared?

45:52.840 --> 45:54.840
They've decided. We only need another two.

45:55.920 --> 45:57.600
Look at my chart.

45:59.770 --> 46:01.810
Check what steps haven't been finished.

46:06.920 --> 46:10.440
Xing, where is the chocolate from?

46:10.680 --> 46:12.010
Zhou Siyue gave it to me.
